     "text": " Kilimanjaro Safaris, Na'vi River Journey, Wildlife Express Train, Gorilla Falls Exploration Trail, Maharajah Jungle Trek, Discovery Island Trails, Conservation Station, Zootopia: Better Zoogether! (show)",
