     "marks": [
      "1218563833b2"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "cd74b088bcfe",
     "text": " in the ride finder.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "0503ec342550",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1c7cb6ed6823",
     "text": "What Changed in 2026: DinoLand Is Closed",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "26a8ecfe6462",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1e4f8b7e1eea",
     "text": "If you are reading older guides, note that DinoLand U.S.A. is gone. DINOSAUR's last day was February 1, 2026, after TriceraTop Spin closed in January 2025 and The Boneyard playground in September 2025. The area is being rebuilt as Tropical Americas, which Disney has said is planned for 2027. Finding Nemo: The Big Blue… and Beyond! is a separate theater show; check the park's entertainment schedule for current times.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "ef098f79254e",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b27e573424dd",
     "text": "Best Animal Kingdom Rides for Kids Under 38 Inches",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "3b29ffba1071",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b568286a429e",
     "text": "Kids this age can do more of Animal Kingdom than any other Disney park. Start here:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "df3f998ba856",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a95b43ae4026",
     "text": "Kilimanjaro Safaris",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "e2d5bce1227b",
     "text": " — an open-sided truck ride through a savanna with giraffes, elephants and more. No height requirement, and it is often the highlight for animal-loving preschoolers. Early in the day can be a good time to ride.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "eb009cefa975",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "7c4f8603ded4",
     "text": "Na'vi River Journey",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a6f39f45b6b1",
     "text": " — a slow, dark-ish boat ride through Pandora's glowing rainforest. Any height. Some young kids find dark rides spooky, so preview it if your child is sensitive.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "95f42c06ebbd",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f7f673402540",
     "text": "Wildlife Express Train",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1b1a27f9cf74",
     "text": " — a short train to Rafiki's Planet Watch and Conservation Station, a good indoor-ish break.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "6fe8fba62da5",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "b959706b33dc",
     "text": "Gorilla Falls Exploration Trail and Maharajah Jungle Trek",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "63e12eb0bb17",
     "text": " — walk-at-your-own-pace trails with gorillas, tigers and birds. Easy to do with a stroller.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "d18fc0bc43f8",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "c98326567c05",
     "text": "Zootopia: Better Zoogether!",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9ddae9529b1b",
     "text": " — a seated indoor show in the Tree of Life Theater, useful for a midday reset.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "22407a77b06a",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [
