    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1ec72dcc34b9",
     "text": " skips anything with drops or sudden motion.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "ff097c42e9b6",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "fcf6c876b9be",
     "text": "Rides for Kids 38 to 43 Inches",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "9353dc0119ec",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "dfc681f72237",
     "text": "At 38 inches, ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "942cb3079d86",
     "text": "Kali River Rapids",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "1d9a02675f0d",
     "text": " opens up. It is a round raft that spins through rapids, and you will get wet — sometimes very wet. Pack a poncho or a change of clothes, and plan it for the warmest part of the day. Everything in the \"any height\" list still applies.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "2c9064164def",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "4173ab7a5d49",
     "text": "Rides for Kids 44 Inches and Up",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "6a8c8f6575fb",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "95a0cae40113",
     "text": "At 44 inches, two headliners open up:",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "f426b30e8f83",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "db969b8e7559",
     "text": "Avatar Flight of Passage",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "9857e73da7b3",
     "text": " — a 3D flying simulator on a motorbike-style seat. It is intense for some kids because of the motion, height illusion and 3D effects, even though it does not have drops in the coaster sense.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "b7d372b9c068",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "f9dfa2dd6f51",
     "text": "Expedition Everest",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "898950fe257b",
     "text": " — a roller coaster with a backward section and a large drop. It is the park's biggest thrill ride; check your child's comfort with coasters first.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ],
   "listItem": "bullet",
   "level": 1
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "dc4e8d775f4f",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6d72fc83352e",
     "text": "If one child is too short or not interested, Disney's ",
     "marks": []
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "a09e246e298c",
     "text": "Rider Switch",
     "marks": [
      "strong"
     ]
    },
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ec60e4b9517a",
     "text": " lets one adult wait with the child while the other adult rides, then swap without waiting in line again (see Disney's Rider Switch page for current rules).",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
