   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "0d1269cc3c9a",
     "text": "Older kids (44\"+) can add Flight of Passage and Expedition Everest, ideally with Lightning Lane or at quieter times. Check current Lightning Lane options and prices in the My Disney Experience app, since they vary by date.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "e87e1779e7b7",
   "style": "h2",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "6402c4b0d240",
     "text": "Heat, Shade and Safety Tips",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "34504f323286",
   "style": "normal",
   "markDefs": [],
   "children": [
    {
     "_type": "span",
     "_key": "ceeda4fe1599",
     "text": "Animal Kingdom has long outdoor walks and Orlando summers are hot and humid. Plan shade and water breaks, bring refillable bottles, and use indoor shows to cool off. If a child shows signs of heat illness, get help from park First Aid or a doctor — Disney lists First Aid in every Walt Disney World theme park.",
     "marks": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "_type": "block",
   "_key": "a355b28a317d",
   "style": "normal",
